ust and a beam. Do you know you said that? Carl Sagan, one of my favorite scientists. And that's what I think of when I look at this visual.\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) What you're seeing right now is actually a time lapse. I'm sorry, a lapse of a hybrid eclipse that took place on Thursday. What dark little circle over Australia is actually the moon's shadow.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RECORD HEAT GLOBALLY\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) My fellow earthlings, this is our planet. But we've been looking at some record heat globally lately. 2022 Europe's 2nd warmest on record. Europe temperatures rising at twice the global rate. We also saw a major record broken in Thailand, 114 degrees.\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) We've got to take care mama Earth. That's a look at the weather across the country, let's see what's going on your part of the planet.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NATIONAL MAP\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230530ej4m0000u\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 DEALS & STEALS EARTH DAY DEALS\b0\par\par\uc2 1,526 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 April 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CRISIS IN SUDAN: DIPLOMAT EVACUATIONS\par \par \uc2 SUDAN, SAUDI ARABIA, DIPLOMATS, EVACUATIONS\par \par \uc2 SUPREME COURT, MIFEPRISTONE, ABORTION\par \par \uc2 SEVERE, WEATHER, STORMS, EAST COAST\par \par \uc2 CONNECTICUT, TANKER, FIRE, RODGERS, LAMONT, DASILVA, STEVENS, EUCALITTO\par \par \uc2 US, UKRAINE, TROOPS, TRAINING, TANKS, ABRAMS, AUSTIN\par \par \uc2 "RUST", BALDWIN, CHARGES, MANSLAUGHTER\par \par \uc2 CALIFORNIA, POLICE, RACISM, HOMOPHOBIA, LAWSUIT, BURRIS, KHAN, THORPE\par \par \uc2 SHOOTING, SUSPECT, CUSTODY, NORTH CAROLINA\par \par \uc2 PASTOR, HYDRO-PANELS, WATER, WOODBERRY, GRAVES\par \par 